    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemstone Realm is a game that uses a triple play mechanism. In the game, players will play as a hero, exploring mysterious worlds and randomly opening portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each portal will form a secret realm, where there will be some dangerous monsters and a large number of gems scattered on the ground. Heroes keep coming to fight monsters. We need to be aware that these gems will help us in battle. If the gems are linked together by three, they can have different effects, causing damage and healing wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By successfully hunting these monsters, we will obtain various gems that can help heroes grow.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemstone Realm is a game that uses a triple play mechanism. In the game, players will play as a hero, exploring mysterious worlds and randomly opening portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each portal will form a secret realm, where there will be some dangerous monsters and a large number of gems scattered on the ground. Heroes keep coming to fight monsters. We need to be aware that these gems will help us in battle. If the gems are linked together by three, they can have different effects, causing damage and healing wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By successfully hunting these monsters, we will obtain various gems that can help heroes grow.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore unknown secret caves, successfully hunt monsters inside, and obtain various mysterious power hungry gems. These angry gems not only help us grow, but also have the opportunity to be exchanged for US dollars and fiat currency. Endless Adventure and Wealth - All in the Secret Gem Realm",
